DTSTAMP:20261004T000000Z
DTSTART:20261004T180000
DTEND:20261004T200000
SUMMARY:Baldwin Pops Founder's Day Concert
DESCRIPTION:The volunteer Baldwin Pops stage a free Founder's Day concert 
 at Henry George Park on the Bluff\, Sunday at 6 PM. Baldwin Pops states i
 ts public concerts never require a ticket\, so seating is first come\, fi
